    "turn_text": "Senate Democrats say they have the 51 votes needed to pass their 1.9 trillion COVID relief bill, which President Joe Biden is expected to sign. The bill cuts $1,400 stimulus checks, as well as gives $86 billion in bailouts for union pensions. Here is House caucus chairman, Hakeem Jeffries, Democrat of New York, talking about the bill to media on Tuesday via the Hill.",
