        "text": "The Biden administration is requesting that the Supreme Court dismiss a case related to former President Donald Trump's immigration policies.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "The case involves Trump's 'public charge' rule, which restricts immigrants who may use government benefits from obtaining permanent residency.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The Supreme Court agreed to hear the case after the Trump administration modified the definition of 'public charge' in 2019.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
