        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "China has made its intentions very clear.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The U.S. 5G technology must remain clean and free from Chinese involvement.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "China is actively attempting to insert its technology into global infrastructure.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Allowing Chinese technology in 5G infrastructure could create a backdoor to China.",
